  "name": "v13-pools-on-any-factory",
  "description": "A contract whose token0() or token1() is the launch token is a pool whatever its factory: one from a listed factory (reason with the factory label), one from a factory not in the list (token1), one whose factory() and token1() do not answer. Holders that stay holders: a pair from a listed factory without this token, a contract where only factory() answers, a Safe. A pool holding less than the floor is never weighed, so never probed and not listed among the exclusions. A pool also listed by hand keeps the listed reason.",
  "covers": [
    "pool detection by token0/token1 on any factory",
    "unlisted and missing factory() reasons",
    "only weighed addresses are probed",
    "look-alikes stay holders"
  ],
